    "detailed_description": "You were a normal kid living on an island. Until the island is flooded.<br><br>The sea level, which was always on the news, is now a reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/782b6e1aad6e537b364a998f18bcf6f6.poster.avif?t=1694912914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/782b6e1aad6e537b364a998f18bcf6f6.webm?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/782b6e1aad6e537b364a998f18bcf6f6.mp4?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You have two choices. You adapt to reality, you give up, you struggle to survive.<br><br>But you know. I'll choose to struggle and survive in this cruel place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/98e6b3766ab901ad58b6d227d089f27d.poster.avif?t=1694912914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/98e6b3766ab901ad58b6d227d089f27d.webm?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/98e6b3766ab901ad58b6d227d089f27d.mp4?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The first step. Feel me getting more confident every time I take the first step.<br><br>We are not the stars of this earth. Even at this moment, my competitors are ahead.<br><br>But you won't give up. Make supporting people with stories into supporting roles until you become the main characters.<br><br>Even if you're born with nothing, even if you live in a moment, there's definitely a meaning in this life. Unless you give up!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/b04e6bfcee0b2cef6a417e19357f00bf.poster.avif?t=1694912914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/b04e6bfcee0b2cef6a417e19357f00bf.webm?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/b04e6bfcee0b2cef6a417e19357f00bf.mp4?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong><br><br>Only go up is a game where you go up to avoid the rising water.<br><br>Each time you go up, the concept and chapter of the map change.<br><br>For example, in a two-chapter <i>(melted Arctic)</i>, the character's friction will decrease and it will slip!<br><br>But don't worry. I'll make a checkpoint for you here.<br><br>Then, Only go up!<br><br><br><i>In addition...<br><br>This checkpoint function exists, but if you're a person who gives up easily, think twice about purchasing.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "You were a normal kid living on an island. Until the island is flooded.<br><br>The sea level, which was always on the news, is now a reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/782b6e1aad6e537b364a998f18bcf6f6.poster.avif?t=1694912914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/782b6e1aad6e537b364a998f18bcf6f6.webm?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/782b6e1aad6e537b364a998f18bcf6f6.mp4?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You have two choices. You adapt to reality, you give up, you struggle to survive.<br><br>But you know. I'll choose to struggle and survive in this cruel place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/98e6b3766ab901ad58b6d227d089f27d.poster.avif?t=1694912914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/98e6b3766ab901ad58b6d227d089f27d.webm?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/98e6b3766ab901ad58b6d227d089f27d.mp4?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The first step. Feel me getting more confident every time I take the first step.<br><br>We are not the stars of this earth. Even at this moment, my competitors are ahead.<br><br>But you won't give up. Make supporting people with stories into supporting roles until you become the main characters.<br><br>Even if you're born with nothing, even if you live in a moment, there's definitely a meaning in this life. Unless you give up!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/b04e6bfcee0b2cef6a417e19357f00bf.poster.avif?t=1694912914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/b04e6bfcee0b2cef6a417e19357f00bf.webm?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543340/extras/b04e6bfcee0b2cef6a417e19357f00bf.mp4?t=1694912914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong><br><br>Only go up is a game where you go up to avoid the rising water.<br><br>Each time you go up, the concept and chapter of the map change.<br><br>For example, in a two-chapter <i>(melted Arctic)</i>, the character's friction will decrease and it will slip!<br><br>But don't worry. I'll make a checkpoint for you here.<br><br>Then, Only go up!<br><br><br><i>In addition...<br><br>This checkpoint function exists, but if you're a person who gives up easily, think twice about purchasing.</i>",
